a70=Rest[$ScriptCommandLine];If[Length[a70]<2,Exit[2]];in70=Import[a70[[1]],"RawJSON"];out70=a70[[2]];If[!DirectoryQ[out70],CreateDirectory[out70,CreateIntermediateDirectories->True]];
ClearAll[cell70,screen70];
cell70[j_]:=Module[{n=j["N"],d=j["d"],mm=j["M"],wp=j["precision"],mu,step,c,hh,ih,fn,v},mu=x/.FindRoot[x==1+Exp[-x],{x,N[5/4,wp+30]},WorkingPrecision->wp+30];step=mu/d;c=If[j["mode"]==="finite",mu,Infinity];hh[s_?NumericQ]:=If[c===Infinity,s^(n-1)/Factorial[n-1],Sum[Binomial[n,k]Max[s-c k,0]^(n-1),{k,0,n}]/Factorial[n-1]];ih[x_?NumericQ]:=Sum[(-1)^k Binomial[n,k]Max[x-k,0]^(n-1),{k,0,n}]/Factorial[n-1];fn[x_?NumericQ]:=If[x==0&&mm==0,step,step^n Exp[-step(mm+x)]ih[x]/hh[step(mm+x)]];v=Total[Table[NIntegrate[fn[x],{x,k,k+1},WorkingPrecision->wp,AccuracyGoal->Floor[wp/3],PrecisionGoal->Floor[wp/3],MaxRecursion->12],{k,0,n-1}]];<|"mu_root_residual"->ToString[N[Abs[mu-1-Exp[-mu]],20],InputForm],"N"->n,"d"->d,"M"->mm,"mode"->j["mode"],"precision"->wp,"probability"->ToString[N[v,35],InputForm],"numeric"->TrueQ[NumberQ[v]&&0<v<1&&Abs[mu-1-Exp[-mu]]<10^(-Floor[wp/2])]|>];
screen70[j_]:=Module[{n=ToExpression[j["N"]],wp=j["precision"],A=j["A"],eps=ToExpression[j["epsilon"]],mu,z,q0,kap,H,q,lp,chosen,optimal,res},mu=x/.FindRoot[x==1+Exp[-x],{x,N[5/4,wp+30]},WorkingPrecision->wp+30];z=x/.FindRoot[Erfc[x/Sqrt[2]]/2==Sqrt[mu/n]x,{x,N[Sqrt[Log[n]],wp+20]},WorkingPrecision->wp+20];q0=n mu-Sqrt[mu n]z;kap=(9-mu)/24;H=Log[A]+(n-1)Log[1+Log[A]]+q0+(kap-eps)Log[n];q=x/.FindRoot[x-Log[x]==H+1,{x,N[H+Log[H]+2,wp+10]},WorkingPrecision->wp+10];lp=q/(q-1)Log[q]+H/(q-1);optimal=Exp[lp];chosen=Exp[1+(1+1/H)Log[H+1]];res=Abs[q-Log[q]-H-1];<|"mu_root_residual"->ToString[N[Abs[mu-1-Exp[-mu]],20],InputForm],"normal_root_residual"->ToString[N[Abs[Erfc[z/Sqrt[2]]/2-Sqrt[mu/n]z],20],InputForm],"N"->ToString[n],"A"->A,"epsilon"->j["epsilon"],"precision"->wp,"canonical_threshold"->"exp(-q0)*N^(-alpha+epsilon); asymptotic reference, not an exact Q_N value","H_over_N"->ToString[N[H/n,35],InputForm],"optimized_factor_over_N"->ToString[N[optimal/n,35],InputForm],"chosen_factor_over_N"->ToString[N[chosen/n,35],InputForm],"optimal_root_residual"->ToString[N[res,20],InputForm],"numeric"->TrueQ[NumberQ[optimal]&&H>1&&chosen<=2E(H+1)&&res<10^(-Floor[wp/2])&&Abs[mu-1-Exp[-mu]]<10^(-Floor[wp/2])&&Abs[Erfc[z/Sqrt[2]]/2-Sqrt[mu/n]z]<10^(-Floor[wp/2])]|>];
LaunchKernels[12];ParallelEvaluate[$HistoryLength=0];DistributeDefinitions[cell70,screen70];start70=AbsoluteTime[];cells70=ParallelMap[cell70,in70["cells"],Method->"FinestGrained"];screens70=ParallelMap[screen70,in70["screens"],Method->"FinestGrained"];CloseKernels[];checks70=<|"mixture_mass"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[Integrate[(nn-1)(1-u)^(nn-2),{u,0,1},Assumptions->nn>1]==1,Assumptions->nn>1]],"covariance_gap"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[((s+t)^2-s^2-t^2)/(nn(nn+1))==2s t/(nn(nn+1)),Assumptions->nn>1&&s>0&&t>0]],"power_boundary"->TrueQ[Log[2]-Log[2]==0],"power_derivative_bound"->TrueQ[FullSimplify[1/(h+1)<=1/2,Assumptions->h>=1]],"power_strict_slope"->TrueQ[1/2<Log[2]]|>;
Export[FileNameJoin[{out70,"kernel70.json"}],<|"version"->$Version,"workers"->12,"seconds"->N[AbsoluteTime[]-start70],"cells"->cells70,"screens"->screens70,"checks"->checks70|>,"RawJSON"];If[!AllTrue[Join[cells70,screens70],TrueQ[#["numeric"]]&]||!AllTrue[Values[checks70],TrueQ],Print["FAILED kernel70"];Exit[3]];Print["PASS ",Length[cells70]," cell and ",Length[screens70]," screening cases"];
